# Vite inlines VITE_* values into the bundle at BUILD time — they are not read
# at runtime, and they are visible to anyone who opens devtools. Never put a
# secret here.
#
# Set VITE_API_BASE_URL in the Vercel project (Settings -> Environment
# Variables, Production scope) to the deployed API origin, e.g.
#   https://stock-dependency-tracker.onrender.com/api
# A real environment variable takes precedence over this file, so the value
# below is only the fallback.
#
# Whatever origin Vercel serves must also be listed in the API's
# CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS, or the browser will block every request.
#
# The same-origin default is deliberate: it fails visibly rather than silently
# pointing a production build at localhost.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
